# Per-feature settings drop-ins.
#
# Files placed here as <feature>.conf are copied to
# /var/packages/IKEv2VPN/etc/settings.d/ on install and are read by
# load_settings() (bin/lib/settings.sh) after settings.conf, so a feature can
# keep its own settings in its own file instead of adding them to the shared
# settings.conf.
